---
source: crates/rune-config/tests/env_files.rs
description: an env file saved as UTF-16
expression: error
---
.env is UTF-16, and rune reads env files as UTF-8

save it as UTF-8 in your editor, or convert it in place:

  on Windows: powershell -Command "(Get-Content .env) | Set-Content -Encoding utf8 .env"
  elsewhere:  iconv -f UTF-16 -t UTF-8 .env > converted && mv converted .env
